            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A communication system is described comprising: a user apparatus and multiple base stations each configured to wirelessly communicate with the user apparatus, wherein the multiple base stations include a master base station and a secondary base station in dual connectivity, and wherein the secondary base station wirelessly communicates with the user apparatus in a control plane (C-plane).</p>
            </abstract>
